    "description": {
      "content": "Amazon Elastic Load Balancing automatically distributes incoming application traffic across multiple targets, such as Amazon EC2 instances, containers, IP addresses, and Lambda functions. It supports Application Load Balancers, Network Load Balancers, and Gateway Load Balancers.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amazon Web Services",
